<!--BlockML Documentation — create a new A02 DocSet
  FQN: org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a02_structuring.task.A02_01_UpdateDocSet-->
<task:A02_01_UpdateDocSet xmlns="http://blockml.org/bml"
  xmlns:task="org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a02_structuring.task"
  xmlns:workflow="org.blockml.bml.transformer.workflow"
  xmlns:type="org.blockml.bml.type">

  <baseType>
    workflow:InstructionTask
  </baseType>
  <is>
    A task that creates a new A02 DocSet
  </is>
  <documentation>
    A02 structuring task: wipe a02_structuring.data, then create a new
    BmlDocSet_A02 from BmlDocSetPlan.

    - **Wipe** — if the live A02 data package exists, delete it first.
      Previous data contents are never input, even while they are deleted
    - **Identity** — title, version, and summary come only from the plan
    - **Packages** — recreate a02 subpackages data, page, and pagegroup
    - **Aggregations** — pages and pageGroups stay empty for later A02 tasks
    - **Sources** — this task has no authoritativeSources
  </documentation>
  <properties>
    <instructions type="type:Text" override="true">
      <value>
        <![CDATA[
          All information for this task comes from the plan. Do not read
          authoritativeSources on this task or on BmlDocSetPlan. Do not invent
          title, version, or summary that the plan does not state. Do not
          read, merge, or reuse any existing A02 data contents.

          Live A02 data package: org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a02_structuring.data
          Live A02 data path:
          packages/bmldocs/blocks/org/blockml/bml/bmldocs/a02_structuring/data/

          1. Read the plan
          Read org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a01_planning.data.BmlDocSetPlan. Collect
          title, version, and summary. Those three values are the DocSet
          identity fields this task copies. Do not walk PagePlan or
          PageGroupPlan entries. Do not create or edit pages, PageGroups,
          or pageMapping.

          2. Delete live A02 data if it exists
          If the live A02 data tree exists, delete it entirely — the data
          path above and every descendant package (data.page, data.pagegroup,
          data.page.docs, and any other child). Delete every .bml file in
          that tree. Remove those A02 data Blocks from
          org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.Library. Do not remove A01 catalog
          entries, task entries, or other sectors.

          Existing contents in that tree are never input. Do not inspect
          them, copy from them, or preserve pages, pageGroups, homePage,
          or rootPageGroup from a previous BmlDocSet_A02. Ignore them
          even while deleting them.

          After this step A02 has no live data Blocks. Then continue.

          3. Create A02 subpackages
          Under org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a02_structuring, create these
          packages (they are missing after step 2):
          - data → org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a02_structuring.data
          - page → org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a02_structuring.data.page
          - pagegroup → org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a02_structuring.data.pagegroup

          Create only the package directories (the filesystem homes for the
          new DocSet and for later A02 pages and PageGroups). Do not invent
          pages or PageGroups. Do not create packages outside a02.

          4. Resolve the A02 DocSet FQN
          DocSet FQN =
          org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a02_structuring.data.BmlDocSet_A02
          Write only this a02 DocSet, never a DocSet outside a02 (a03 or any
          later sector). Do not edit DocSets of other sectors.

          5. Create a new BmlDocSet_A02
          Always create a new DocSet. After step 2 there is no previous
          BmlDocSet_A02 to update. Example of the target path:
          packages/bmldocs/blocks/org/blockml/bml/bmldocs/a02_structuring/data/BmlDocSet_A02.bml

          Each DocSet must:
          - use baseType org.blockml.bml.docgen.core.DocSet
          - use BmlDocSet_A02 as the Block name
          - set is to one short identity sentence from the plan title /
            summary (for example "The BlockML core documentation set")
          - set isNot to contrast with a single DocPage and with a bml-core
            narrative Documentation Block
          - set documentation to restate the plan summary and to name that
            pages / homePage are filled by A02_02_UpdatePageSkeletons and
            pageGroups / rootPageGroup by A02_03_UpdatePageGroups
          - override title from BmlDocSetPlan.title
          - override version from BmlDocSetPlan.version
          - override summary from BmlDocSetPlan.summary
          - declare aggregations pages and pageGroups so later A02 tasks can
            register TypeReferenceEntity links there
          - leave pages and pageGroups as empty compositions
          - set globalRules to TypeReferenceEntity links of every subRule
            on org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.lib.rule.CrossCuttingRules (inspect
            that composite, then list each child). Those are set-wide
            rules; do not copy AuthoringRules or RenderingRules here
          - omit homePage and rootPageGroup
          - omit learningPaths
          - omit every other aggregation

          6. Export BmlDocSet_A02 from the catalog
          Export org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.a02_structuring.data.BmlDocSet_A02
          from org.blockml.bml.bmldocs.Library if it is not already in the
          catalog. Do not remove catalog entries of other sectors.
        ]]>
      </value>
    </instructions>
  </properties>
</task:A02_01_UpdateDocSet>
